<!--
    Framework compatibility matrix for the Infinix GT 20 Pro (X6871).

    XOS 16.3 is a pure AIDL vendor, so the previously HIDL-based Transsion
    entries (trancamserver, tneengine) are declared as AIDL here.
-->
